{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53726","headline":"祭韩吏部文附诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"祭韩吏部文附诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岐山威凤不复鸣，华亭别鹤中夜惊。\n畏简书兮拘印绶，思临恸兮志莫就。\n生刍一束酒一杯，故人故人歆此来。\n（见《刘宾客外集》卷十）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53726.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53726","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}